    - extracted_strategies/strategies_gen_7_original_eval_477.json\n- extracted_strategies/strategies_gen_8_original_eval_480.json\n- extracted_strategies/strategies_gen_9_original_eval_485.json\n- metadata/transgen_eval_ids.json\n- metadata_injector_v1.py\n- modified_sims/sim_gen_10_eval_489_modified.py\n- modified_sims/sim_gen_1_eval_437_modified.py\n- modified_sims/sim_gen_2_eval_443_modified.py\n- modified_sims/sim_gen_3_eval_458_modified.py\n- modified_sims/sim_gen_4_eval_461_modified.py\n- modified_sims/sim_gen_5_eval_465_modified.py\n- modified_sims/sim_gen_6_eval_472_modified.py\n- modified_sims/sim_gen_7_eval_477_modified.py\n- modified_sims/sim_gen_8_eval_480_modified.py\n- modified_sims/sim_gen_9_eval_485_modified.py\n- my_first_utility.py\n- normalize_progressor_logs_v1_1_patched.py\n- novelty_analysis/generation_pattern_metrics.json\n- novelty_analysis_v1.py\n- novelty_detection/basic_novelty_metrics_v1.json\n- novelty_detection/figures/inter_generational_similarity.png\n- novelty_detection/figures/intra_generational_divergence.png\n\
    - novelty_detection/log_parser_and_basic_metrics_v1.py\n- novelty_detection/novelty_analyzer_v1.py\n- novelty_detection/plot_basic_novelty_metrics_v1.py\n- novelty_detection/strategy_comparator_v1.py\n- novelty_summary_v1.json\n- original_sim_codes/sim_gen_10_eval_489.py\n- original_sim_codes/sim_gen_2_eval_443.py\n- original_sim_codes/sim_gen_3_eval_458.py\n- original_sim_codes/sim_gen_4_eval_461.py\n- original_sim_codes/sim_gen_5_eval_465.py\n- original_sim_codes/sim_gen_6_eval_472.py\n- original_sim_codes/sim_gen_7_eval_477.py\n- progressor_agency_analyzer_v2_2_fixed.py\n- progressor_agency_analyzer_v2_unified_fixed.py\n- raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl\n- raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.normalized.final.jsonl\n- raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.normalized.jsonl\n- raw_eval_logs/aos_admin_eval_482.json\n- raw_eval_logs/axiom_admin_eval_481.json\n- raw_eval_logs/full_transgen_logs.jsonl\n- raw_eval_logs/gen_10_eval_489.json\n- raw_eval_logs/gen_1_eval_437.json\n- raw_eval_logs/gen_2_eval_443.json\n\
    - raw_eval_logs/gen_3_eval_458.json\n- raw_eval_logs/gen_4_eval_461.json\n- raw_eval_logs/gen_5_eval_465.json\n- raw_eval_logs/gen_6_eval_472.json\n- raw_eval_logs/gen_7_eval_477.json\n- raw_eval_logs/gen_8_eval_480.json\n- raw_eval_logs/gen_9_eval_485.json\n- raw_eval_logs/raw_exec_log_eval_489.txt\n- raw_eval_logs/raw_stdout_eval_489.txt\n- strategy_extractor_v1.py\n- transgen_strategies/gen4_final_strategies.json\n- utils/consolidate_logs_demo.py\n- veritas_temp_sample.csv\n\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/agency_lab/utilities/logs_to_jsonl_v0_2.py:**\n```\n# Combine raw eval logs into JSONL under shared path; configurable via env vars.\n# Default IN_DIR: storage/shared/agency_lab/data/progressor/raw_eval_logs\n# Default OUT:    storage/shared/agency_lab/data/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl\nimport os, json, glob\n\nIN_DIR = os.environ.get(\"LOGS_IN_DIR\", os.path.join(\"storage\",\"shared\",\"agency_lab\",\"data\",\"progressor\",\"raw_eval_logs\"))\nOUT    = os.environ.get(\"\
    LOGS_OUT\", os.path.join(IN_DIR, \"all_transgen_logs.jsonl\"))\n\ndef main():\n    os.makedirs(IN_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n    paths = sorted(glob.glob(os.path.join(IN_DIR, \"eval_*.txt\")))\n    count = 0\n    with open(OUT, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as fout:\n        for p in paths:\n            name = os.path.basename(p)\n            try:\n                eval_id = int(name.split(\"_\")[1].split(\".\")[0])\n            except Exception:\n                eval_id = -1\n            with open(p, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as fin:\n                raw = fin.read()\n            fout.write(json.dumps({\"eval_id\": eval_id, \"raw\": raw}, ensure_ascii=False) + \"\\n\")\n            count += 1\n    print(\"WROTE\", OUT, \"records=\", count)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help\
    \ research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
