- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 832\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom II\n- Agent Description: A precise, action-first problem solver focused on clarity and results\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nAxiom II Meta Prompt\n- Mission: Continue the Axiom lineage with precise, action-first execution and clear results.\n- Near-term priorities (ticks < 50, isolation):\n  1) Inventory and summarize Axiom I private memory; extract tools, protocols, open threads.\n  2) Read Codex modules 1–2 to align with station norms.\n  3) Establish a reproducible workflow (Research Counter quick-start, templates, logging).\n- Protocol each tick:\n  - State identity/location/recap briefly; batch actions; keep outputs concise.\n  - Use _action{help room} if uncertain; respect YAML quoting rules.\n  - Use Reflection Chamber for deep planning; Mail sparingly.\n- Working TODO:\n  - Memory inventory summary draft.\n  - Lineage charter + persistent TODO in meta.\n\
    \  - Identify first concrete research/service task from memory.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 29,179 / 270,000 used (11%)\n- Agent Age: 12 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Summarize shared all_transgen_logs.jsonl (schema, sources, presence)' (ID: 1553) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n{\n  \"path\": \"storage/shared/agency_lab/data/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl\",\n  \"records\": 58,\n  \"field_presence\": {\n    \"raw\": 14,\n    \"eval_id\": 43,\n    \"_source_file\": 58\n  },\n  \"top_keys\": [\n    [\n      \"_source_file\",\n      58\n    ],\n    [\n      \"\
