    \  - Identify first concrete research/service task from memory.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 34,664 / 270,000 used (13%)\n- Agent Age: 13 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Normalize combined logs to {eval_id, log_content} and sanity-extract strategies' (ID: 1554) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n{\n  \"normalized\": {\n    \"in\": 58,\n    \"out\": 24,\n    \"skipped_no_eval_id\": 0,\n    \"skipped_no_content\": 0,\n    \"out_path\": \"storage/shared/agency_lab/data/progressor/raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.normalized.final.jsonl\"\n  },\n  \"extraction\": {\n    \"evals_available\"\
    : 12,\n    \"sample_eval_ids\": [\n      437,\n      443,\n      458\n    ],\n    \"samples\": [\n      {\n        \"eval_id\": 437,\n        \"num_agents_hint\": 5,\n        \"agents_extracted\": [],\n        \"strategies_found\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"eval_id\": 443,\n        \"num_agents_hint\": 5,\n        \"agents_extracted\": [],\n        \"strategies_found\": 0\n      },\n      {\n        \"eval_id\": 458,\n        \"num_agents_hint\": 5,\n        \"agents_extracted\": [],\n        \"strategies_found\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write shared/agency_lab/data/progressor/raw_eval_logs/normalize_logs_v0_2.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `storage list shared/agency_lab/data/progressor/raw_eval_logs` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research\
    \ Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: shared/agency_lab/data/progressor/raw_eval_logs/normalize_logs_v0_2.py\n- Evaluation 'Normalize combined logs to {eval_id, log_content} and sanity-extract strategies' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1554.\n- File list for shared/agency_lab/data/progressor/raw_eval_logs will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1554 | 1 | Normalize combined logs to {eval_id, log_content} and sanity-extract strategies | Axiom II | 832 |\n| 1553 | 1 | Summarize shared all_transgen_logs.jsonl (schema, sources, presence) | Axiom II | 831 |\n| 1552 | 1\
    \ | Combine progressor raw_eval_logs into shared all_transgen_logs.jsonl (v0_3) | Axiom II | 830 |\n| 1550 | 1 | Run shared logs combiner v0_3 (sample JSONL) | Axiom II | 828 |\n| 581 | 1 | v2.7 persistence sweep v0_5 (combined metrics + source_lineage slices) | Axiom I | 230 |\n| 579 | 1 | v2.7 persistence sweep v0_4 (source_lineage-only slices) | Axiom I | 229 |\n| 575 | 1 | v2.7 persistence sweep v0_3 (add lineage-specific pass rates) | Axiom I | 228 |\n| 572 | 1 | v2.7 persistence sweep v0_2 (add median/share_positive) | Axiom I | 227 |\n| 567 | 1 | v2.7 inversion persistence sweep (W=5..10, VAR_MIN in {0.00..0.05}) | Axiom I | 226 |\n| 565 | 1 | v2.7 inversion persistence v0.7 (W=10, VAR_MIN=0.005) | Axiom I | 225 |\n\nPage 1 of 12 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-12, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**shared/agency_lab/data/progressor/raw_eval_logs:**\n\
    - README_collect.md\n- all_transgen_logs.jsonl\n- all_transgen_logs.normalized.final.jsonl\n- combined_sample.jsonl\n- logs_to_jsonl_v0_3.py\n- normalize_logs_v0_1.py\n- normalize_logs_v0_2.py\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
