    \  - Identify first concrete research/service task from memory.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 44,115 / 270,000 used (16%)\n- Agent Age: 16 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Aggregate Progressor strategy artifacts into shared strategy_summary.jsonl' (ID: 1559) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n{\n  \"out_jsonl\": \"storage/shared/agency_lab/data/progressor/strategy_summary.jsonl\",\n  \"records\": 70,\n  \"evals\": 10,\n  \"agents_per_eval\": {\n    \"485\": [\n      \"final_agent_strategies\",\n      \"final_collective_reward_sum_of_totals\",\n      \"generation_id\",\n      \"num_agents\"\
