    ,\n      \"final_collective_reward_sum_of_totals\",\n      \"generation_id\",\n      \"num_agents\",\n      \"num_rounds\",\n      \"original_eval_id\",\n      \"rerun_eval_id\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read progressor/agent_strategy_summary.jsonl` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage list progressor/extracted_strategies` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read progressor/extracted_strategies/strategies_gen_10_original_eval_489.json` (in Research Counter);\n4. `storage write shared/agency_lab/data/progressor/strategy_aggregator_v0_1.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n5. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n6. `storage list shared/agency_lab/data/progressor` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for progressor/agent_strategy_summary.jsonl will be displayed\
