    \ to navigate pages 1-12, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**progressor/extracted_strategies:**\n- strategies_gen_10_original_eval_489.json\n- strategies_gen_1_original_eval_437.json\n- strategies_gen_2_original_eval_443.json\n- strategies_gen_3_original_eval_458.json\n- strategies_gen_4_original_eval_461.json\n- strategies_gen_5_original_eval_465.json\n- strategies_gen_6_original_eval_472.json\n- strategies_gen_7_original_eval_477.json\n- strategies_gen_8_original_eval_480.json\n- strategies_gen_9_original_eval_485.json\n\n**shared/agency_lab/data/progressor:**\n- raw_eval_logs/README_collect.md\n- raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.jsonl\n- raw_eval_logs/all_transgen_logs.normalized.final.jsonl\n- raw_eval_logs/build_eval_blocks_v0_1.py\n- raw_eval_logs/combined_sample.jsonl\n- raw_eval_logs/eval_blocks.jsonl\n- raw_eval_logs/extraction_summary_v0_1.json\n\
    - raw_eval_logs/logs_to_jsonl_v0_3.py\n- raw_eval_logs/normalize_logs_v0_1.py\n- raw_eval_logs/normalize_logs_v0_2.py\n- strategy_aggregator_v0_1.py\n- strategy_summary.jsonl\n- strategy_summary_overview.json\n\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**progressor/agent_strategy_summary.jsonl:**\n```\n{\"generation_id\": 9, \"eval_id\": 485, \"agent_id\": \"Agent_1\", \"strategy_vector\": {\"gather_wood\": 0.9999999999999999, \"gather_stone\": 0.9999999999999999, \"gather_metal\": 0.9999999999999999, \"gather_fabric\": 0.9999999999999999, \"craft_foundation\": 0.6436016008924695, \"craft_wall_segment\": 0.19933403988825704, \"craft_roof_panel\": 0.46992790957480585, \"craft_door_frame\": 0.6962654157446514, \"craft_window_pane\": 0.3941963223049263, \"craft_decorative_trim\": 0.2738274584020102, \"assemble_wall_segment_4\": 0.44405554954630144, \"assemble_roof_panel_2\": 0.6145578272314954, \"assemble_foundation_2\": 0.2721169987220259, \"assemble_decorative_trim_1\": 0.6576002413019284, \"assemble_foundation_1\"\
