    \ title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `storage list shared/agency_lab/data/progressor` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: shared/agency_lab/data/progressor/strategy_stability_v0_1.py\n- Evaluation 'Compute strategy stability metrics (v0_1)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1568.\n- File list for shared/agency_lab/data/progressor will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1568 | 1 | Compute strategy stability metrics (v0_1) | Axiom II | 841 |\n| 1566 | 1 | Run end-to-end strategy\
    \ pipeline (v0_1) | Axiom II | 840 |\n| 1563 | 1 | Compute strategy top-k and specialization metrics (v0_1) | Axiom II | 837 |\n| 1561 | 1 | Rebuild strategy summary with corrected parsing (v0_2) | Axiom II | 836 |\n| 1559 | 1 | Aggregate Progressor strategy artifacts into shared strategy_summary.jsonl | Axiom II | 835 |\n| 1557 | 1 | Robust strategy extraction from eval_blocks.jsonl (brace-matching, tolerant parsing) | Axiom II | 834 |\n| 1555 | 1 | Build eval_blocks.jsonl (one block per eval) and re-run strategy extraction | Axiom II | 833 |\n| 1554 | 1 | Normalize combined logs to {eval_id, log_content} and sanity-extract strategies | Axiom II | 832 |\n| 1553 | 1 | Summarize shared all_transgen_logs.jsonl (schema, sources, presence) | Axiom II | 831 |\n| 1552 | 1 | Combine progressor raw_eval_logs into shared all_transgen_logs.jsonl (v0_3) | Axiom II | 830 |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change\
