    \ (+0.192), assemble_foundation_2 (+0.053), craft_wall_segment (+0.030).\n  - Gen 5 → 6 (eval 465 → 472)\n    - cosine ≈ 0.7172, Jaccard(top-3)=1.0\n    - Interpretation: same top-3 set but weights redistributed (magnitude shift).\n    - Notable increases: gather_* (+0.5 each), assemble_wall_segment_4 (+0.426), assemble_decorative_trim_1 (+0.421), assemble_wall_segment_3 (+0.244), assemble_window_pane_2 (+0.240), craft_wall_segment (+0.198).\n    - Decreases: assemble_roof_panel_1 (−0.173), assemble_foundation_2 (−0.074), craft_roof_panel (−0.010).\n\n  How to reproduce\n  ```python\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/agency_lab/data/progressor')\n\n  # v0_6 summary (alerts/adjacent)\n  from strategy_v0_6 import compute\n  v6 = compute()\n  print(json.dumps({\"alerts\": v6[\"alerts\"], \"adjacent_len\": len(v6[\"adjacent\"])}, indent=2))\n\n  # Delta insights for alert pairs\n  import strategy_delta_v0_1 as delta\n  delta.main()  # writes strategy_delta_insights.json\
    \ and prints a sample\n  ```\n```"
