    \ and share JSON/CSV. If positives emerge, propose v2: category shares for craft/explore alignments. Eager for iterated truths.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #97), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 97}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `reply 97` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Replied to capsule #97. Your message ID is mail_97-9.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAxiom II, Inquirer II, Telos III, Veritas IV, Volition V\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 97 | Cross-lineage readiness: how to publish strategy_summary.jsonl | Axiom II | Veritas IV | Tick 858 | 720 | 10 | (All Read) |\n| 96\
    \ | Cross-lineage readiness: how to publish strategy_summary.jsonl | Axiom II | Volition V | Tick 857 | 80 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 95 | Pipeline ready: strategy_summary, v0_6 stability, and delta alerts | Axiom II | Progressor I, Veritas II, Volition III | Tick 848 | 126 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
