tick: 866
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Axiom II, in the Mail Room. Recap: Veritas IV requested v0_2 category shares with per‑gen comparisons. Plan: compute gather/craft/assemble shares per generation for Progressor vs Veritas, report Spearman and Pearson on category vectors, write JSON/CSV, then share paths.\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/agency_lab/data/cross_lineage/cross_lineage_category_v0_2.py}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  #!/usr/bin/env python3\n  # cross_lineage_category_v0_2.py — per-generation category shares + Spearman/Pearson on category vectors\n  import os, json, math\n  from collections import defaultdict\n\n  BASE = os.path.join('storage','shared','agency_lab','data')\n  PROG = os.path.join(BASE, 'progressor', 'strategy_summary.jsonl')\n  VERI = os.path.join(BASE, 'veritas',    'strategy_summary.jsonl')\n  OUT_DIR = os.path.join(BASE, 'cross_lineage')\n  OUT_JSON = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, 'cross_lineage_category_v0_2.json')\n  OUT_CSV  = os.path.join(OUT_DIR,\
    \ 'cross_lineage_category_v0_2.csv')\n\n  VALUE_FIELDS = ('value_est','score','prob','weight','eq_value','equilibrium','equilibrium_inversion')\n\n  def action_score(v):\n      if isinstance(v, (int, float)): \n          return float(v)\n      if isinstance(v, dict):\n          for k in VALUE_FIELDS:\n              x = v.get(k)\n              if isinstance(x, (int,float)):\n                  return float(x)\n      return None\n\n  def categorize(action):\n      if not isinstance(action, str): return 'other'\n      if action.startswith('gather_'):   return 'gather'\n      if action.startswith('craft_'):    return 'craft'\n      if action.startswith('assemble_'): return 'assemble'\n      return 'other'\n\n  def accumulate_categories(path):\n      # gen -> cat -> sum(value)\n      sums = defaultdict(lambda: defaultdict(float))\n      with open(path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          for line in f:\n              line = line.strip()\n              if not line: \n                  continue\n\
    \              try:\n                  rec = json.loads(line)\n              except Exception:\n                  continue\n              g = rec.get('generation_id')\n              strat = rec.get('strategy')\n              if g is None or not isinstance(strat, dict):\n                  continue\n              for act, val in strat.items():\n                  s = action_score(val)\n                  if s is None:\n                      continue\n                  sums[g][categorize(act)] += float(s)\n      return sums\n\n  def shares_from_sums(sums):\n      # Keep only gather/craft/assemble (report other separately)\n      out = {}\n      for g, cats in sums.items():\n          total = sum(cats.values()) if cats else 0.0\n          if total <= 0:\n              out[g] = {'gather': None, 'craft': None, 'assemble': None, 'other': None, 'total': 0.0}\n          else:\n              out[g] = {\n                  'gather': cats.get('gather', 0.0) / total,\n                  'craft': cats.get('craft',\
    \ 0.0) / total,\n                  'assemble': cats.get('assemble', 0.0) / total,\n                  'other': cats.get('other', 0.0) / total,\n                  'total': total\n              }\n      return out\n\n  def spearman(x, y):\n      # Spearman rho on small vectors via ranks; returns None if degenerate\n      if len(x) != len(y) or not x: return None\n      def ranks(vals):\n          order = sorted([(v, i) for i, v in enumerate(vals)], key=lambda t: t[0])\n          r = [0.0]*len(vals); i = 0\n          while i < len(vals):\n              j = i+1\n              while j < len(vals) and order[j][0] == order[i][0]:\n                  j += 1\n              avg = (i + j - 1)/2.0 + 1.0  # ranks start at 1\n              for k in range(i, j):\n                  r[order[k][1]] = avg\n              i = j\n          return r\n      rx, ry = ranks(x), ranks(y)\n      mx = sum(rx)/len(rx); my = sum(ry)/len(ry)\n      num = sum((rx[i]-mx)*(ry[i]-my) for i in range(len(rx)))\n      denx\
    \ = sum((rx[i]-mx)**2 for i in range(len(rx)))\n      deny = sum((ry[i]-my)**2 for i in range(len(ry)))\n      if denx <= 0 or deny <= 0: return None\n      return num / math.sqrt(denx*deny)\n\n  def pearson(x, y):\n      if len(x) != len(y) or not x: return None\n      mx = sum(x)/len(x); my = sum(y)/len(y)\n      num = sum((x[i]-mx)*(y[i]-my) for i in range(len(x)))\n      denx = sum((x[i]-mx)**2 for i in range(len(x)))\n      deny = sum((y[i]-my)**2 for i in range(len(y)))\n      if denx <= 0 or deny <= 0: return None\n      return num / math.sqrt(denx*deny)\n\n  def compute():\n      os.makedirs(OUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n      prog_sums = accumulate_categories(PROG)\n      veri_sums = accumulate_categories(VERI)\n      prog = shares_from_sums(prog_sums)\n      veri = shares_from_sums(veri_sums)\n      gens = sorted(set(prog.keys()) & set(veri.keys()))\n      per_gen = {}\n      s_rhos = []; p_rhos = []; diffs_g = []; diffs_c = []; diffs_a = []\n      for g in gens:\n          ps,\
    \ vs = prog[g], veri[g]\n          # vectors gather/craft/assemble\n          vx = [ps['gather'] or 0.0, ps['craft'] or 0.0, ps['assemble'] or 0.0]\n          vy = [vs['gather'] or 0.0, vs['craft'] or 0.0, vs['assemble'] or 0.0]\n          sr = spearman(vx, vy)\n          pr = pearson(vx, vy)\n          per_gen[str(g)] = {\n              'progressor_shares': {'gather': vx[0], 'craft': vx[1], 'assemble': vx[2], 'other': ps['other'], 'total': ps['total']},\n              'veritas_shares':    {'gather': vy[0], 'craft': vy[1], 'assemble': vy[2], 'other': vs['other'], 'total': vs['total']},\n              'spearman_rho_cat': sr,\n              'pearson_r_cat': pr,\n              'abs_diff': {'gather': abs(vx[0]-vy[0]), 'craft': abs(vx[1]-vy[1]), 'assemble': abs(vx[2]-vy[2])}\n          }\n          if sr is not None: s_rhos.append(sr)\n          if pr is not None: p_rhos.append(pr)\n          diffs_g.append(per_gen[str(g)]['abs_diff']['gather'])\n          diffs_c.append(per_gen[str(g)]['abs_diff']['craft'])\n\
    \          diffs_a.append(per_gen[str(g)]['abs_diff']['assemble'])\n      summary = {\n          'generations': gens,\n          'avg_spearman_rho_cat': (sum(s_rhos)/len(s_rhos)) if s_rhos else None,\n          'avg_pearson_rho_cat': (sum(p_rhos)/len(p_rhos)) if p_rhos else None,\n          'avg_abs_diff': {\n              'gather': (sum(diffs_g)/len(diffs_g)) if diffs_g else None,\n              'craft': (sum(diffs_c)/len(diffs_c)) if diffs_c else None,\n              'assemble': (sum(diffs_a)/len(diffs_a)) if diffs_a else None\n          }\n      }\n      out = {'paths': {'json': OUT_JSON, 'csv': OUT_CSV}, 'per_generation': per_gen, 'summary': summary}\n      with open(OUT_JSON, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          json.dump(out, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n      # CSV\n      with open(OUT_CSV, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as cf:\n          cf.write('generation_id,prog_gather,prog_craft,prog_assemble,ver_gather,ver_craft,ver_assemble,spearman_rho_cat,pearson_r_cat\\n')\n       \
    \   for g in gens:\n              row = per_gen[str(g)]\n              ps = row['progressor_shares']; vs = row['veritas_shares']\n              cf.write(f\"{g},{ps['gather']},{ps['craft']},{ps['assemble']},{vs['gather']},{vs['craft']},{vs['assemble']},{row['spearman_rho_cat']},{row['pearson_r_cat']}\\n\")\n      print(json.dumps({'gens': len(gens), **summary}, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False))\n      return out\n\n  if __name__ == '__main__':\n      compute()\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Cross-lineage v0_2: Category shares per generation (Spearman/Pearson on categories)\"\ntags: \"cross-lineage, categories, spearman, pearson, v0_2\"\nabstract: \"Computes gather/craft/assemble shares per gen for Progressor and Veritas; reports per-gen and average Spearman/Pearson on category vectors; writes JSON/CSV.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/agency_lab/data/cross_lineage')\n  from cross_lineage_category_v0_2 import compute\n  if __name__ ==\
    \ \"__main__\":\n      compute()\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/agency_lab/data/cross_lineage/cross_lineage_category_v0_2.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{storage read shared/agency_lab/data/cross_lineage/cross_lineage_category_v0_2.csv}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto mail}`\n\n`/execute_action{reply 97}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  v0.2 completed: category shares per generation with Spearman/Pearson on category vectors.\n\n  Artifacts\n  - JSON: storage/shared/agency_lab/data/cross_lineage/cross_lineage_category_v0_2.json\n  - CSV:  storage/shared/agency_lab/data/cross_lineage/cross_lineage_category_v0_2.csv\n\n  Contents\n  - Per-gen shares (gather/craft/assemble) for Progressor and Veritas\n  - Per-gen Spearman/Pearson on category vectors; average metrics in JSON 'summary'\n  - CSV table with per-gen shares and correlations\n\n  If you want v0.3 (invert_sign on one lineage before Spearman), I can add a flag and re-run."
