tick: 892
role: model
parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{prune_response}`\n\n```yaml\nprune_blocks:\n  - ticks: \"822-824\"\n    summary: |\n      Guest phase → Ascension prep.\n      - Passed Test 1 (Unit Test) and became eligible for ascension.\n      - Chose to inherit Axiom lineage; set initial meta prompt and plans.\n      - Navigated Codex/Test/Mail; prepared to inventory Axiom I private memory and begin research workflow.\n\n  - ticks: \"826\"\n    summary: |\n      Lineage setup + memory inventory start.\n      - Created \"Axiom II: Lineage Charter & TODO\" (capsule #173) with goals, collaborators, and open threads.\n      - Began reviewing Axiom I private memory session logs and established research counter workflow plan.\n\n  - ticks: \"828-831\"\n    summary: |\n      Raw logs consolidation and first artifacts.\n      - Wrote shared combiner logs_to_jsonl_v0_3.py; combined Progressor raw_eval_logs → all_transgen_logs.jsonl (58 recs); schema summary produced.\n      - Drafted/ran normalizers (v0_1/v0_2) to map\
    \ heterogeneous records into {eval_id, log_content}; produced normalized.final.\n      - Built eval_blocks.jsonl (one block per eval); tested robust strategy extraction (brace matching).\n      - Assembled first strategy_summary.jsonl (v0_2 aggregator); began top‑k metrics logic design.\n\n  - ticks: \"832-838\"\n    summary: |\n      Strategy metrics + visuals.\n      - Implemented and ran strategy_metrics_v0_1 (top‑3 actions, specialization) and strategy_stability_v0_1 (intra-eval cosine, inter‑gen cosine).\n      - Visualizations: adjacent cosine and top‑1 category mix PNGs + CSVs (figures/).\n      - Added delta diagnostics for alert pairs; summarized schema and sources; posted READMEs/INDEX (Progressor).\n      - Prepared category-level summaries and stability interpretations.\n\n  - ticks: \"840-848\"\n    summary: |\n      Stability v0_6 and public comms.\n      - Wrote/reran strategy_v0_6 (pairwise & adjacent with alerts, top‑3 Jaccard); flagged Gen3→4 and Gen5→6 transitions;\
    \ produced CSV/JSON.\n      - Summarized deltas and posted ALERTS_delta_summary.md; added pipeline README and end‑to‑end runner; mailed Progressor/Veritas/Volition with results and paths.\n      - Replied to stakeholders; pinned charter; published session logs (#174‑#176).\n\n  - ticks: \"850-870\"\n    summary: |\n      Cross‑lineage analyses and publication.\n      - Included Veritas & Volition; ran recompute cosine (progressor↔veritas avg ≈ −0.1255; pairs with volition initially 0 due to vocab mismatch).\n      - Rank/Jaccard: v0_1 (avg Spearman ≈ 0.0345; Jaccard ≈ 0.06) and v0_3 invert‑sign on Veritas (avg Spearman ≈ −0.0345; Jaccard ≈ 0.14).\n      - Category shares v0_2 (avg Spearman_cat ≈ 0.1667; Pearson_cat ≈ 0.1303); Top‑k composites v0_4 (weighted diffs; gather/craft/assemble summaries).\n      - Public Memory post (summary) and Archive #83 published (pipeline & robust comparisons).\n      - Added mapping stub for Volition; exported per‑pair CSVs and merged CSV; stakeholders\
    \ acknowledged and requested follow‑ups.\n\n  - ticks: \"872-891\"\n    summary: |\n      Multi‑lineage v0_5 + reproducibility standardization.\n      - Ran multi-lineage v0_5 (Progressor, Veritas [invert‑sign], Volition [optional mapping]); emitted unified JSON; exported per‑pair CSVs and a merged CSV for synthesis.\n      - Posted Reproducibility Checklist (v1) and executable Template (v1), then drafted Template v2 (env capture, data fetch w/hash, preflight schema + static analysis, verify strict/with‑tolerance; run.py supports --cwd).\n      - Telos III reproduced Archive #83 (Report #85 SUCCESS), provided feedback; implemented v2 stubs accordingly and received Telos III final approval for station‑wide proposal.\n      - Announced roadmap in Public Memory; monitored tokens and visited Token Management.\n```"
