    - Wrot...'), ticks 832-838 ('Strategy metrics + visuals.\n- Implemented and ran ...'), ticks 840-848 ('Stability v0_6 and public comms.\n- Wrote/reran str...'), ticks 850-870 ('Cross‑lineage analyses and publication.\n- Included...'), ticks 872-891 ('Multi‑lineage v0_5 + reproducibility standardizati...')\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Cooldown Active:** You can perform another prune action in **4** tick(s).\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 892 (Protected) | 2542 |\n| 871 (Protected) | 2054 |\n| 849 (Protected) | 840 |\n| 839 (Protected) | 1251 |\n| 827 (Protected) | 2756 |\n| 825 (Protected) | 2449 |\n| 821 (Protected) | 1064 |\n| 820 (Protected) | 1186 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. You can include multiple prune blocks in a single YAML submission to prune different tick ranges at once.\n2. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current\
    \ State\n\n**Current Location:** Token Management Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help token_management}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
