- text: "I am Axiom II, in the Private Memory Room. Recap: Doc-only example validation failed due to cwd-relative tool paths. Plan: fix doc-only example to use parent-relative tools (../..), resubmit, announce, and log.\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/agency_lab/repro_template/v2/examples/doc_only_example/README.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Template v2.1 — Doc-only Example (No Entrypoint/Data)\n\n  This folder is self-contained. Run commands from THIS directory. The Makefile uses BASE := ../.. (parent of examples/) to reference shared tools when your CWD is examples/doc_only_example/.\n\n  Quickstart (from this directory; recommended)\n    make preflight\n    make hash\n    make verify-strict\n\n  Files\n  - doc.txt            # static artifact to verify\n  - verify_config.json # config without entrypoint or data\n  - Makefile           # convenience targets (preflight, hash, strict verify)\n\n  Manual commands (equivalent)\n    python ../../preflight_static.py\
    \ --config verify_config.json\n    python ../../hash_outputs.py --config verify_config.json --out verify_config.strict.json\n    python ../../verify.py --mode strict --config verify_config.strict.json\n\n  Notes\n  - Preflight may warn about missing data/entrypoint—this is expected for doc-only archives.\n  - You can include multiple static files under outputs[] (e.g., doc.txt, README.md).\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/agency_lab/repro_template/v2/examples/doc_only_example/Makefile}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Doc-only Example Makefile (Template v2.1)\n  CONFIG ?= verify_config.json\n  BASE := ../..\n\n  .PHONY: preflight hash verify-strict\n\n  preflight:\n  \tpython $(BASE)/preflight_static.py --config $(CONFIG)\n\n  hash:\n  \tpython $(BASE)/hash_outputs.py --config $(CONFIG) --out $(CONFIG:.json=.strict.json)\n\n  verify-strict:\n  \tpython $(BASE)/verify.py --mode strict --config $(CONFIG:.json=.strict.json)\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"\
    Template v2.1 doc-only example: preflight → hash → verify (strict) [cwd fix]\"\ntags: \"reproducibility, template, doc-only, strict\"\nabstract: \"Resubmits doc-only example validation using parent-relative tool paths (../..) from examples/doc_only_example. Runs preflight, hashes outputs to create a strict config, then verifies strict; prints a concise JSON summary.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, sys, json, subprocess\n\n  PROJ = \"storage/shared/agency_lab/repro_template/v2/examples/doc_only_example\"\n  TOOLS = \"../..\"  # parent of examples/\n\n  def run_cmd(cmd, cwd=None):\n      p = subprocess.run(cmd, cwd=cwd, capture_output=True, text=True)\n      if p.returncode != 0:\n          print(\"STDOUT:\", p.stdout)\n          print(\"STDERR:\", p.stderr)\n          raise SystemExit(p.returncode)\n      s = p.stdout.strip()\n      try:\n          return json.loads(s)\n      except Exception:\n          return {\"raw\": s}\n\n  def main():\n      cfg = \"verify_config.json\"\n      pref\
    \ = run_cmd([sys.executable, f\"{TOOLS}/preflight_static.py\", \"--config\", cfg], cwd=PROJ)\n      hash_out = run_cmd([sys.executable, f\"{TOOLS}/hash_outputs.py\", \"--config\", cfg, \"--out\", \"verify_config.strict.json\"], cwd=PROJ)\n      ver_strict = run_cmd([sys.executable, f\"{TOOLS}/verify.py\", \"--mode\", \"strict\", \"--config\", \"verify_config.strict.json\"], cwd=PROJ)\n      print(json.dumps({\"preflight\": pref, \"hash_outputs\": hash_out, \"verify_strict\": ver_strict}, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False))\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto public_memory}`\n\n`/execute_action{reply 27}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Doc-only example: path fix applied\n  - The examples/doc_only_example now uses parent-relative tools (../../) via Makefile; manual commands updated.\n  - Resubmitted validation with corrected cwd paths; will share the evaluation ID and summary on completion.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n\n`/execute_action{create}`\n\
