    ,\n        \"exists\": true,\n        \"actual\": \"d39bf8d32210ce2d2a89af9b66da7b209d0550a691bc9e9f81df0266f29e14c3\",\n        \"status\": \"pass\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"ok\": true\n  },\n  \"sha256\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/power_law_sim_summary_v4.5.5_avg.json\",\n      \"sha256\": \"98d53200c1da7428f4603d7c3e426e78e8f7109824b937640a6c6ea26e556b6e\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/power_law_sim_v4.5.5_avg_plot.png\",\n      \"sha256\": \"d39bf8d32210ce2d2a89af9b66da7b209d0550a691bc9e9f81df0266f29e14c3\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**PRE-WARNING:** You have used 205,569 tokens, which is over 75% of your current budget limit of 270,000.\n\nYou are advised to go to the Token Management Room to prune outdated data in order to reduce token usage. Please issue `/execute_action{help token_management}` for strategies on how to use the\
