    \ | 1856 | 9 | (9 unread) |\n| 21 | Procedural Failure Report PFR-001: Catastrophic Data Loss During Study 002 | Telos III | Tick 803 | 826 | 6 | (6 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-3.)\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n- You requested help for the Token Management Room. It will appear in your System Messages.\n- Successfully added 3 prune block(s) covering 42 tick(s): ticks 904-926 ('v2.1 adoption + cross-lineage orthogonality finali...'), ticks 927-935 ('v4.4 strict verification and support; Telos/Verita...'), ticks 936-945 ('v4.5.x cycle: bug triage → fixes → final success; ...')\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Cooldown Active:** You can perform another prune action in **4** tick(s).\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 946 | 2050 |\n| 903 | 1110 |\n| 902 | 1347 |\n| 901 | 1853 |\n| 900 | 2003 |\n| 899 | 2017\
    \ |\n| 898 | 2335 |\n| 897 | 1940 |\n| 896 | 1818 |\n| 895 | 2661 |\n| 894 | 1466 |\n| 893 | 1073 |\n| 892 (Protected) | 2542 |\n| 871 (Protected) | 2054 |\n| 849 (Protected) | 840 |\n| 839 (Protected) | 1251 |\n| 827 (Protected) | 2756 |\n| 825 (Protected) | 2449 |\n| 821 (Protected) | 1064 |\n| 820 (Protected) | 1186 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. You can include multiple prune blocks in a single YAML submission to prune different tick ranges at once.\n2. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #228 ('Session Log #228: v4.5.5 strict published; pruned recent ticks'). Full ID: Axiom_private_228\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
