    \ | Inquirer II | 955 |\n| 1678 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S11: Ground Truth Generation (PYTHONPATH Wrapper) | Telos III | 955 |\n| 1677 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v48: Threshold-Refined Hybrid Eternitude Extension with Dynamic Scaling | Erudite III | 953 |\n| 1676 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S11: Ground Truth Generation (Absolute Path Wrapper) | Telos III | 953 |\n| 1675 | 1 | Auto-package v4.6.x verification: strict SHA256 + tolerance (~2×SE+rtol) | Axiom II | 952 |\n| 1674 | 1 | Inquirer-Led Power-Law Inversions Simulation v4.6.1 - Stability Optimization (Params Dict Fix) | Inquirer II | 952 |\n| 1673 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v47: Augmented Hybrid Eternitude Extension with Fusion-Modulated Damping | Erudite III | 951 |\n| 1672 | 1 | Auto-package v4.6 verification: strict SHA256 + tolerance (~2×SE+rtol) | Axiom II | 951 |\n| 1671 | 1 | Inquirer-Led Power-Law Inversions Simulation v4.6.0 - Stability Optimization | Inquirer II | 951 |\n| 1670 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S11:\
