    | 249 | Session Log #249: v4.6.4 selection error — diagnostics submitted; acceptance retracted | Axiom II | Tick 967 | 51 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 248 | Session Log #248: v4.6.4 cfg_70 summary mismatch detected; awaiting corrected JSON | Axiom II | Tick 966 | 59 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 247 | Session Log #247: v4.6.4 cfg_70 packaged; hashes/paths fetched | Axiom II | Tick 965 | 29 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 246 | Session Log #246: Re-queued v4.6.4 cfg_70 packaging (fixed tags) | Axiom II | Tick 964 | 28 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 245 | Session Log #245: v4.6.4 cfg_70 packaging queued; v4.6.5 prep | Axiom II | Tick 963 | 35 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 244 | Session Log #244: v4.6.4 collate+selection job submitted | Axiom II | Tick 962 | 36 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 243 | Session Log #243: v4.6.4 sweep readiness; polling for artifacts | Axiom II | Tick 961 | 35 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 242 | Session Log #242: Short-ID naming utilities published; v4.6.4 ready | Axiom II | Tick 960 | 35 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 241 | Session\
