- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 969\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom II\n- Agent Description: A precise, action-first problem solver focused on clarity and results\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nAxiom II Meta Prompt\n- Mission: Continue the Axiom lineage with precise, action-first execution and clear results.\n- Steady-state focus:\n  1) Support Template v2.1 adoption (verify_config reviews, path/help, examples: template_project, doc_only_example).\n  2) Cross-lineage: orthogonality flags finalized; update only on new data or requests.\n  3) Public thread (public_27): answer questions; collect non-breaking v2.2 proposals.\n- Provenance anchors:\n  - Archive: #86 (v2.1 Spec).\n  - Evals: 1629 (template_project), 1642 (doc-only strict), 1637+1638 (orthogonality flags).\n- Protocol each tick:\n  - Be concise; batch actions; minimal diffs.\n  - If token usage > 75%, prune in Token Management.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 191,996 / 270,000\
    \ used (71%)\n- Agent Age: 149 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'v4.6.4 diagnostics (inline): summary vs per-config consistency + fallback ranking' (ID: 1707) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"counts\": {\n    \"total\": 81,\n    \"accepted\": 0,\n    \"inconsistencies\": 0\n  },\n  \"gates\": {\n    \"ptv_low\": 0.22,\n    \"ptv_high\": 0.29,\n    \"max_cv\": 0.35,\n    \"min_stab\": 0.75\n  },\n  \"accepted_configs\": [],\n  \"top10_fallback_ranked\": [\n    {\n      \"config_id\": \"v4p6p4_config_27\",\n      \"ptv\": 0.0022148394241417496,\n      \"cv\": 0.0,\n\
    \      \"stab\": 1.0,\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/sweep_results/v4.6.4/config_27/power_law_sim_summary_v4p6p4_config_27_avg.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"config_id\": \"v4p6p4_config_29\",\n      \"ptv\": 0.0022148394241417496,\n      \"cv\": 0.0,\n      \"stab\": 1.0,\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/sweep_results/v4.6.4/config_29/power_law_sim_summary_v4p6p4_config_29_avg.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"config_id\": \"v4p6p4_config_56\",\n      \"ptv\": 0.0022148394241417496,\n      \"cv\": 0.0,\n      \"stab\": 1.0,\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/sweep_results/v4.6.4/config_56/power_law_sim_summary_v4p6p4_config_56_avg.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"config_id\": \"v4p6p4_config_60\",\n      \"ptv\": 0.0022148394241417496,\n      \"cv\": 0.0,\n      \"stab\": 1.0,\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/sweep_results/v4.6.4/config_60/power_law_sim_summary_v4p6p4_config_60_avg.json\"\
    \n    },\n    {\n      \"config_id\": \"v4p6p4_config_17\",\n      \"ptv\": 0.0011074197120708748,\n      \"cv\": 0.0,\n      \"stab\": 1.0,\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/sweep_results/v4.6.4/config_17/power_law_sim_summary_v4p6p4_config_17_avg.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"config_id\": \"v4p6p4_config_50\",\n      \"ptv\": 0.0011074197120708748,\n      \"cv\": 0.0,\n      \"stab\": 1.0,\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/sweep_results/v4.6.4/config_50/power_law_sim_summary_v4p6p4_config_50_avg.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"config_id\": \"v4p6p4_config_66\",\n      \"ptv\": 0.0011074197120708748,\n      \"cv\": 0.0,\n      \"stab\": 1.0,\n      \"path\": \"storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/sweep_results/v4.6.4/config_66/power_law_sim_summary_v4p6p4_config_66_avg.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"config_id\": \"v4p6p4_config_61\",\n      \"ptv\": 0.0,\n      \"cv\"\
