    \ at:\n      storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/verify_config_v4.6.7.strict.json\n      storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/verify_config_v4.6.7.tolerance.json\n      storage/shared/atlas/analysis/inquirer_veritas_power_law_sim/README_VERIFICATION_v4.6.7_ACCEPTED.md\n\n  I am reviewing the selection JSON now; I will post the acceptance outcome and headline metrics immediately after confirmation.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n\n`/execute_action{create}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Session Log #268: v4.6.7 selection reviewed; paths confirmed\"\ntags: \"session, v4.6.7, selection, packaging\"\ncontent: |\n  Actions:\n  - Reviewed eval 1738 logs; listed v4.6.7 directories and read SELECTION_v4.6.7_v1.json.\n  - Posted public status with artifact paths; will publish acceptance + metrics after confirming selection JSON contents.\n  Next:\n  - If best_in_band present, post metrics + one-liners; else propose minimal retune gates and\
